  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "酸味と　苦味を　わずかに　感じる　調味料。ミニーブが　好む　においの　オイルは質が高いため　特に　珍重されている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신맛과 쓴맛을 살짝 느낄 수 있는 조미료. 미니브가 좋아하는 향의 오일은 품질이 좋아서 특히 더 귀하게 여겨진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "會隱約感覺到酸味和苦味的調味料。帶有迷你芙喜歡的氣味的油屬高品質，因此格外受到珍惜。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condiment au goût légèrement acide et amer. Les huiles les plus prisées sont celles dont les Olivini apprécient l’odeur, ce qui est un gage de qualité certain.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Würzmittel versprüht einen Hauch saurer und bitterer Aromen. Öle, deren Duft Olini zusagt, gelten als sehr hochwertig und sind heißbegehrt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento de sabor ligeramente ácido y amargo. El aceite más preciado es aquel cuyo aroma aprecian los Smoliv, pues significa que es de mejor calidad.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un condimento leggermente aspro e amaro. Gli oli con un profumo amato dagli Smoliv sono molto ricercati perché di alta qualità.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A condiment offering faint notes of sour and bitter flavors. The most prized varieties are the ones Smoliv love the smell of—such oils’ quality is assured.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "酸味と　苦味を　わずかに　感じる　調味料。ミニーブが　好む　においの　オイルは質が高いため　特に　珍重されている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能稍微尝到酸味和苦味的调味料。带有迷你芙喜欢味道的油品质很高，所以会特别受到珍重。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
